# Ignore python cache files and environments
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pyo
**/venv/
**/.venv/
.env
.env.*

# Ignore OS-specific files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Ignore Phase walkthroughs
walkthrough.md
**/walkthrough.md

# Ignore generated test files and user data
**/data/screenshots/*
!**/data/screenshots/.gitkeep
**/data/db/*
!**/data/db/.gitkeep
**/data/watchlist/*
!**/data/watchlist/.gitkeep
